### =====================================================
### STARLIGHT STAYS — API Test Requests
### Use with VS Code REST Client or IntelliJ HTTP Client
### =====================================================

### ==================== DIRECT SERVICE TESTS ====================

### [USER-SERVICE] Register a new user
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "deepak",
    "password": "pass123",
    "email": "deepak@klu.ac.in",
    "role": "USER"
}

###

### [USER-SERVICE] Login and get JWT token
POST http://localhost:8081/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "deepak",
    "password": "pass123"
}

###

### [ROOM-SERVICE] Get all rooms
GET http://localhost:8082/api/rooms

###

### [ROOM-SERVICE] Search rooms by location
GET http://localhost:8082/api/rooms/search?location=Maldives

###

### [ROOM-SERVICE] Search rooms with multiple filters
GET http://localhost:8082/api/rooms/search?location=Bali&type=VILLA&maxPrice=65000

###

### [ROOM-SERVICE] Get room by ID
GET http://localhost:8082/api/rooms/1

###

### [BOOKING-SERVICE] Create a booking
POST http://localhost:8083/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "roomId": 1,
    "roomName": "Ocean Breeze Deluxe",
    "roomType": "DELUXE",
    "location": "Maldives",
    "userId": "deepak",
    "checkIn": "2026-10-15",
    "checkOut": "2026-10-20",
    "guests": 2,
    "totalPrice": 92500,
    "image": "/images/room-deluxe.jpg"
}

###

### [BOOKING-SERVICE] Get user bookings
GET http://localhost:8083/api/bookings/user/deepak

###

### [BOOKING-SERVICE] Cancel a booking (change ID as needed)
DELETE http://localhost:8083/api/bookings/1

###

### ==================== GATEWAY TESTS (via :8765) ====================

### [GATEWAY] Register user (public — no JWT needed)
POST http://localhost:8765/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "satya",
    "password": "pass123",
    "email": "satya@klu.ac.in",
    "role": "USER"
}

###

### [GATEWAY] Login via Gateway (public — no JWT needed)
POST http://localhost:8765/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "deepak",
    "password": "pass123"
}

###

### [GATEWAY] Get all rooms (PROTECTED — needs JWT Bearer token)
### Replace <YOUR_JWT_TOKEN> with the token from login response
GET http://localhost:8765/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_JWT_TOKEN>

###

### [GATEWAY] Search rooms via Gateway (PROTECTED)
GET http://localhost:8765/api/rooms/search?location=Maldives&type=DELUXE
Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_JWT_TOKEN>

###

### [GATEWAY] Create booking via Gateway (PROTECTED)
POST http://localhost:8765/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_JWT_TOKEN>

{
    "roomId": 3,
    "roomName": "Tropical Garden Villa",
    "roomType": "VILLA",
    "location": "Bali",
    "userId": "deepak",
    "checkIn": "2026-11-01",
    "checkOut": "2026-11-07",
    "guests": 4,
    "totalPrice": 372000,
    "image": "/images/room-villa.jpg"
}

###

### [GATEWAY] Get user bookings via Gateway (PROTECTED)
GET http://localhost:8765/api/bookings/user/deepak
Authorization: Bearer <YOUR_JWT_TOKEN>

###

### [GATEWAY] Test without token (should get 401 Unauthorized)
GET http://localhost:8765/api/rooms

###

### [GATEWAY] Test with invalid token (should get 401)
GET http://localhost:8765/api/rooms
Authorization: Bearer invalid.token.here

###
